
§§ `s 376B`

-- s 376B(1): commercial sex with minor below 18 years of age
-- @fixture `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1` OF `Commercial Sex Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused obtains for consideration the sexual services of a person
-- T the person whose sexual services are in question is below 18 years of age
-- T the services are sexual services within section 376B(4)
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376B(1)` `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376B(1)` `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376B(1)` `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`)'s section EQUALS "376B(1)"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376B(1)` `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`)'s offence EQUALS "commercial sex with minor below 18 years of age"
